  "title": "Unified title",
  "summary": "DeforM addresses the limitations of video-language models in physics-aware reasoning by introducing a spatial-temporal masking approach, while PhyParam-Dataset and PhyParam-Bench provide a foundation for physics-guided image-to-video generation.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "DeforM introduces a VLM-guided physical reasoning module to identify and localize critical regions in dynamic scenes.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "PhyParam-Dataset and PhyParam-Bench are built on physically simulated videos with dense physical parameterization.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "PhyParam uses lightweight physical-attention routing to condition on object-level forces, masses, and scene-level gravity.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
